# Computation

Source documenting the "Computation" mental model, a universal conceptual tool for navigating complex situations through pattern and relationship recognition. Cross-referenced with Brian Christian and Tom Griffiths' *The Most Human Human*, which examines what makes humans uniquely human in the age of AI through the lens of computation, language, and judgment.